1265
01:08:49,240 --> 01:08:49,460
Cool!

1266
01:08:50,600 --> 01:08:54,100
I would love to get a lot of netherite at once, you know?

1267
01:08:54,200 --> 01:08:54,740
Because it's so rare.

1268
01:08:57,060 --> 01:08:57,880
