1273
01:09:24,940 --> 01:09:25,140
Okay.

1274
01:09:26,220 --> 01:09:26,980
Never again!

1275
01:09:33,740 --> 01:09:34,940
Never go that way again.

1276
01:09:35,740 --> 01:09:36,460
It's wrong.

1277
