1292
01:10:47,930 --> 01:10:48,730
Let's go, Jimmy!

1293
01:10:50,810 --> 01:10:51,550
In you go.

1294
01:10:51,830 --> 01:10:52,670
There we are.

1295
01:10:55,860 --> 01:10:56,860
