I know it's raining, but that's okay.

1304
01:11:19,220 --> 01:11:19,860
You're a pig.

1305
01:11:21,360 --> 01:11:22,180
You don't mind.

1306
01:11:23,380 --> 01:11:23,900
Alright!

1307
01:11:24,100 --> 01:11:26,140
Look at all that iron.

1308
