1312
01:11:35,780 --> 01:11:37,040
It was to make...

1313
01:11:38,980 --> 01:11:39,340
Something.

1314
01:11:42,080 --> 01:11:42,440
Also...

1315
01:11:42,920 --> 01:11:44,040
How about we take this...

1316
01:11:47,700 --> 01:11:48,980
