1317
01:11:51,960 --> 01:11:53,060
Oh, did I put it in here?

1318
01:11:53,220 --> 01:11:53,760
I must have.

1319
01:12:00,190 --> 01:12:03,050
So exactly what is your deal here and how did you appear?

1320
01:12:04,050 --> 01:12:04,790
I'm kinda...

1321
01:12:04,790 --> 01:12:05,790
Are you stuck in here by the way?

1322
01:12:07,390 --> 01:12:07,990
You wanna...

1323
01:12:07,990 --> 01:12:08,530
You wanna get outside?

1324
01:12:11,150 --> 01:12:11,550
Here.

1325
01:12:13,330 --> 01:12:14,390
I can make that happen.

1326
01:12:16,530 --> 01:12:16,930
Go!

1327
01:12:20,900 --> 01:12:21,440
Come on.

1328
01:12:23,100 --> 01:12:24,440
