1331
01:12:39,900 --> 01:12:41,160
Maybe you'll decide to leave one day.

1332
01:12:41,820 --> 01:12:42,900
Don't know where he came from.

1333
01:12:43,680 --> 01:12:45,000
Maybe it's because of these villagers.

1334
01:12:45,780 --> 01:12:47,120
They're like, oh, bunch of villagers.

1335
01:12:47,140 --> 01:12:47,860
