1336
01:12:50,620 --> 01:12:51,500
So that's cooking.

1337
01:12:51,660 --> 01:12:52,160
That's great.

1338
01:12:55,140 --> 01:12:59,540
So the thing I needed a lot of iron for was...

1339
01:13:04,240 --> 01:13:05,680
Hoppers, of course.

1340
01:13:07,120 --> 01:13:08,240
What else?

1341
01:13:12,200 --> 01:13:12,620
Spencers...

1342
01:13:13,040 --> 01:13:14,780
Something about railways.

1343
01:13:15,240 --> 01:13:15,320
Wait.

1344
01:13:18,800 --> 01:13:19,220
Right.

1345
01:13:19,480 --> 01:13:20,260
Detector rails.

1346
01:13:21,780 --> 01:13:22,600
Mmm.

1347
01:13:23,880 --> 01:13:24,740
