1350
01:13:27,460 --> 01:13:28,060
Thank you.

1351
01:13:30,900 --> 01:13:32,580
And then...

1352
01:13:34,200 --> 01:13:34,580
Um...

1353
01:13:34,580 --> 01:13:34,980
Hold on.

1354
01:13:36,040 --> 01:13:37,260
Think, think, think, think, think, think, think.

1355
01:13:37,440 --> 01:13:37,600
Right.

1356
01:13:37,920 --> 01:13:38,640
Pistons we got.

1357
01:13:39,320 --> 01:13:40,500
We need a plate?

1358
01:13:41,220 --> 01:13:42,260
A plate thingy?

1359
01:13:44,300 --> 01:13:45,280
Stone pressure plate.

1360
01:13:48,560 --> 01:13:48,940
Stone...

1361
01:13:50,740 --> 01:13:51,880
What does it take to make that?

1362
01:13:53,860 --> 01:13:54,240
Pre...

1363
01:13:55,520 --> 01:13:55,900
Oh!

1364
01:13:56,380 --> 01:13:57,580
Oh, I see, I see, I see.

1365
01:13:57,660 --> 01:13:57,840
Okay.

1366
01:13:58,280 --> 01:13:59,320
So not cobblestone.

1367
01:14:01,560 --> 01:14:03,120
You need normal stone.

1368
01:14:06,530 --> 01:14:06,930
Pressure...

1369
01:14:06,930 --> 01:14:07,270
You know what?

1370
01:14:07,290 --> 01:14:08,270
We can make a couple of these.

1371
01:14:09,390 --> 01:14:12,010
Let's make like, one, two, three...

1372
01:14:12,590 --> 01:14:13,210
Or five.

1373
01:14:14,010 --> 01:14:15,830
Because then we can make five detector rails.

1374
01:14:16,130 --> 01:14:17,670
