1375
01:14:20,590 --> 01:14:21,330
And redstone.

1376
01:14:27,560 --> 01:14:27,960
Detector...

1377
01:14:30,380 --> 01:14:32,220
Oh, that makes six a pop?

1378
01:14:33,340 --> 01:14:33,820
Oh!

1379
01:14:36,620 --> 01:14:37,320
That's fine.

1380
01:14:39,180 --> 01:14:40,200
We made 18.

1381
01:14:41,980 --> 01:14:43,020
That's more than enough.

1382
01:14:44,640 --> 01:14:46,660
In fact, I'll just start with one, please.

1383
01:14:50,800 --> 01:14:51,920
And then I needed pistons.

1384
01:14:52,560 --> 01:14:53,240
I got that.

1385
