1391
01:15:23,470 --> 01:15:24,590
Constantly filling this up.

1392
01:15:24,650 --> 01:15:25,810
This is what I wanna eliminate.

1393
01:15:31,400 --> 01:15:32,540
I guess I put that up there.

1394
01:15:35,720 --> 01:15:36,460
Wait a second.

1395
01:15:37,560 --> 01:15:40,340
We could also make something where you enter the house, right?

1396
01:15:42,320 --> 01:15:44,900
You step on the pressure plate and all kinds of shit happens.

1397
01:15:46,480 --> 01:15:48,680
I don't know what, but something.

1398
01:15:49,780 --> 01:15:52,460
What about a simple step inside, all the lights turn on.

1399
01:15:53,040 --> 01:15:54,820
Step outside, all the lights turn off.

1400
01:15:55,380 --> 01:15:55,560
Yo!

1401
01:15:57,000 --> 01:15:58,600
That could be a good little experiment.

1402
01:15:58,960 --> 01:16:00,120
See if I can get that working.

1403
01:16:00,340 --> 01:16:01,840
Anyway, let's focus on one thing at a time.

1404
01:16:02,060 --> 01:16:03,760
I forgot to bring the thing I wanted to bring.

1405
01:16:04,580 --> 01:16:05,400
Which was rails.

1406
01:16:06,300 --> 01:16:07,000
Can't believe it.

1407
01:16:09,400 --> 01:16:10,180
Drops, in.

1408
01:16:11,140 --> 01:16:12,200
Here, in.

1409
01:16:12,900 --> 01:16:13,440
Redstone.

1410
01:16:14,580 --> 01:16:16,080
This can go in here.

1411
01:16:17,380 --> 01:16:17,580
In.

1412
01:16:17,900 --> 01:16:18,880
Iron ingots.

1413
01:16:20,360 --> 01:16:20,900
There.

1414
01:16:21,520 --> 01:16:22,040
Arrows.

1415
01:16:22,180 --> 01:16:23,460
Don't really need that on me right now.

1416
01:16:25,440 --> 01:16:26,380
Same with sticks.

1417
01:16:29,800 --> 01:16:30,340
Gunpowder?

1418
01:16:30,420 --> 01:16:31,580
That's also...

1419
01:16:31,580 --> 01:16:33,780
No, that's actually more like brewing, isn't it?

1420
01:16:35,840 --> 01:16:37,640
Name tag is definitely miscellaneous.

1421
01:16:38,720 --> 01:16:39,700
No, it's a utility item.

1422
01:16:42,780 --> 01:16:44,180
We don't need that much food.

1423
01:16:45,740 --> 01:16:47,480
Crafting table is pretty cool to have.

1424
01:16:47,620 --> 01:16:48,900
The bone can be turned into meal.

1425
